19
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:48,320
but on average you're still playing the odds

20
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:49,320
and doing your best.

21
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:53,000
And furthermore, there are actually our theorems saying

22
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,180
that as long as information is symmetric,

23
00:00:55,180 --> 00:00:57,240
