26
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:04,600
It's just grossly overstating the result.

27
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:07,000
Once I actually got to be a referee on such a textbook

28
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,520
and then I got to, ha, all right,

